  m_Text: 'Example of simple dungeon game.

    You must find room with key which
    will open doors to boss enemy.

    After killing boss enemy door to next level
    will open.

    Touching next level box will generate new unique dungeon

    without
    changing current scene (continous infinite levels)


    Use WSAD keys to move

    Space
    or left mouse button to shot in cursor placement.

    Shift - Sprint'
