  m_Text: 'Dungeon generated with "Build Planner Executor"

    Inside Build Planner
    preset take look on the compositions.

    Rooms are injected with enemy spawn
    Field Setups

    treasure spawns etc.

    Game Controller is finding references
    to the boss gate and

    end level gate at start, using Field Planner names
    like

    "BossRoom" and "Corridors".'
